 "notes": "Public catalog = NCDMV's specialty-plate forms page and its fillable PDFs (all rev. 6-7/2026 except MVR-33A 5/2025 and MVR-49 8/2018); MVR-27's 90-option plate dropdown was read from the PDF's form data (no form filled). Every game plate was matched to a form entry except the three limited-inventory NASCAR drivers (dropped from MVR-27SC, probably sold out; not certain) and 'Private' (unclear what it is). Aurora Fossil Museum (applications opened Feb 2024) and NC Museum of Natural Sciences 'Acrocanthosaurus' (first mailed Sept 2025) are confirmed issued; NCSSM (S.L. 2024-30) is on the MVR-27 dropdown, but no image was found. FOP, IAFF, Retired Highway Patrol/LEO, Horseless Carriage, Army Special Forces, Coast Guard Auxiliary and Amateur Radio are older plates the 2023 snapshot missed, and none has a public image. Left out because they are not on any form: Lifetime Conservationist (S.L. 2026-43), the Semiquincentennial background, and the Surfrider and Battleship pre-order campaigns. Motorcycle-only entries (Blue Ridge Parkway Motorcycle, Antique Motorcycle, POW and DV motorcycle) were skipped. Both sponsor images are plate-shaped (2.0 and 1.88); the Aurora one is a photo of a sample plate on a black background, not a car."
